#: bot/__init__.py:223 bot/__init__.py:286
msgid ""
"This needs Google Chrome, which is not available on this machine's "
"processor architecture."
msgstr ""
"Esto necesita Google Chrome, que no está disponible para la arquitectura "
"de procesador de este equipo."

#: bot/__init__.py:268
msgid "Spotify is unavailable: the player could not start."
msgstr "Spotify no está disponible: el reproductor no pudo iniciarse."

#: bot/__init__.py:301 bot/__init__.py:304 bot/modules/portal_pages.py:543
msgid "The sign-in did not complete."
msgstr "El inicio de sesión no se completó."

#: bot/__init__.py:317
msgid ""
"The account portal is switched off in this bot's configuration, so "
"Netflix, Disney Plus, Apple Music and Amazon Music cannot be connected. "
"Set auth_portal.enabled to true in this bot's config.json and restart it."
" If the manager switched it off for a port clash, there is a file named "
"PORT_CONFLICT.txt in the bot's folder explaining it, and Repair Account "
"Portal and Spotify Ports in the manager turns it back on."
msgstr ""
"El portal de cuentas está desactivado en la configuración de este bot, "
"así que no se pueden conectar Netflix, Disney Plus, Apple Music ni Amazon"
" Music. Pon auth_portal.enabled en true en el config.json de este bot y "
"reinícialo. Si el gestor lo desactivó por un conflicto de puertos, hay un"
" archivo llamado PORT_CONFLICT.txt en la carpeta del bot que lo explica, "
"y la opción Repair Account Portal and Spotify Ports del gestor lo vuelve "
"a activar."

#: bot/__init__.py:370
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The account portal could not start because port %(port)s is already in "
"use, most likely by another bot on this machine. Netflix, Disney Plus, "
"Apple Music and Amazon Music cannot be connected until that is fixed. Run"
" the manager, choose Manage Bots, then Repair Account Portal and Spotify "
"Ports, and restart this bot. YouTube and Spotify are unaffected, because "
"they sign in with a code in the channel."
msgstr ""
"El portal de cuentas no pudo iniciarse porque el puerto %(port)s ya está "
"en uso, probablemente por otro bot de este equipo. No se pueden conectar "
"Netflix, Disney Plus, Apple Music ni Amazon Music hasta que se arregle. "
"Ejecuta el gestor, elige Manage Bots, luego Repair Account Portal and "
"Spotify Ports, y reinicia este bot. YouTube y Spotify no se ven "
"afectados, porque inician sesión con un código en el canal."

#: bot/__init__.py:380
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The account portal could not start, so Netflix, Disney Plus, Apple Music "
"and Amazon Music cannot be connected. The reason is in this bot's log "
"file: %(reason)s"
msgstr ""
"El portal de cuentas no pudo iniciarse, así que no se pueden conectar "
"Netflix, Disney Plus, Apple Music ni Amazon Music. El motivo está en el "
"archivo de registro de este bot: %(reason)s"

#: bot/__init__.py:412
msgid ""
"Hello! I'm back and ready for you to stream again. Thank you for your "
"patience!"
msgstr ""
"¡Hola! Ya estoy de vuelta y listo para que vuelvas a transmitir. ¡Gracias"
" por tu paciencia!"

#: bot/__init__.py:452
msgid ""
"Hello there! It's me, the Streamer Bot, just coming in here to let you "
"know that an update is in progress and I will restart in a few moments to"
" apply it. Thank you!"
msgstr ""
"¡Hola! Soy Streamer Bot y paso a avisar de que hay una actualización en "
"curso y me reiniciaré en unos momentos para aplicarla. ¡Gracias!"

#: bot/__init__.py:497
msgid "Restarted. The new settings are in use."
msgstr "Reiniciado. Los nuevos ajustes ya están en uso."

#: bot/__init__.py:537
msgid "The bot is restarting now to apply the update. See you in a moment!"
msgstr ""
"El bot se está reiniciando ahora para aplicar la actualización. ¡Vuelvo "
"en un instante!"

#: bot/app_vars.py:44
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"StreamerBot for TeamTalk 5.\n"
"Streams YouTube, YouTube Music, Spotify, Apple Music, Amazon Music, "
"Netflix,\n"
"Disney Plus and direct links into a channel, with audio description "
"support.\n"
"Repository: {repo}\n"
"TeamTalk SDK {sdk}.\n"
"Based on TTMediaBot by Amir Gumerov, Vladislav Kopylov, Beqa Gozalishvili"
" and\n"
"Kirill Belousov, and on the fork by Joao Almeida.\n"
msgstr ""
"StreamerBot para TeamTalk 5.\n"
"Transmite YouTube, YouTube Music, Spotify, Apple Music, Amazon Music, "
"Netflix,\n"
"Disney Plus y enlaces directos a un canal, con soporte de "
"audiodescripción.\n"
"Repositorio: {repo}\n"
"TeamTalk SDK {sdk}.\n"
"Basado en TTMediaBot de Amir Gumerov, Vladislav Kopylov, Beqa "
"Gozalishvili y\n"
"Kirill Belousov, y en la versión derivada de Joao Almeida.\n"

